From: "Ryan X. Charles" <ryan@ryanxcharles.com>
Date: Sat, 19 Sep 2026 09:59:46 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Bundle Objective-C highlighting

Methods send messages across the tree,
While headers keep their home in C.
Self gains a color, fields their due;
Old queries learn a trick or two.
